@startuml

title The lifecycle of one fixing observation

hide empty description

state "Required" as required
state "Dormant" as dormant
state "Unofficial" as unofficial
state "Official" as official

[*] --> required : a booked trade subscribes\nto the source for this date

required --> dormant : keyed in advance\nof its fixing date
dormant --> unofficial : every earlier fixing\nof the source is official

required --> unofficial : published by the source,\nor keyed after its publication time

unofficial --> unofficial : overkeyed\n(the published value is kept)

unofficial --> official : authorised by operations\n(raises a fix event)
official --> unofficial : unauthorised or undone\n(raises an undo event)

official --> [*] : no live trade\nrequires it any more

note right of unofficial
    front office may key or overkey;
    only operations may authorise,
    and only after the publication time
end note

note right of official
    the official observations of a source
    form an unbroken prefix in time
end note

@enduml
